{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53198","headline":"诗偈 二十三 · 庞藴","name":"诗偈 二十三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"余有一宝剑，非是世间铁。\n成来更不磨，晶晶白如雪。\n气冲浮云散，光照三千彻。\n吼作狮子声，百兽皆脑裂。\n外国尽归降，衆生悉磨灭。\n灭已复还生，还生作金鐍。\n带将处处行，乐者即爲说。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庞藴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53198.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53198","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}